    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d740">

                <pb facs="0651" n="575" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg575"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/18399</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Special Representative Rodgers
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-06-13T15:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 13, 1916, 3 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>135. Leader of recent raid above Laredo, wearing Carranza uniform and insignia,
                    has been killed. Papers on body showed him to be Lieutenant Colonel Villareal of
                    Carranza Army. Body was also identified by one of the prisoners taken.</p>
                <p>Immediately inform appropriate authorities.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
